In minutes, you can complete the form from your PC, laptop, or smartphone. 
Do you have any unexpected expenses? Need a specific sum before the paycheck? Is someone sick and needs medication? Is there an accident, and you need to pay for repairs? Have you been in a traffic accident and been issued a fine? Or your dream thing is on sale at a considerable discount for just one day? Just download OnCredit and get a quick loan online in Sri Lanka.
We successfully operate in the financial services market and are characterized by stability and security and give the necessary amounts to those who urgently need money. In most cases, we approve our clients' applications without any problems. It is essential to meet all the requirements on the service's website and provide accurate information about yourself. Considering that a new client usually gets a minimum credit sum would be best. But in case of timely repayment and compliance with all the arrangements spelled out in the agreement, it will be higher next time.
You need to know the terms of repayment to get an express loan:
- age of the majority of the applicants;
- citizenship of Sri Lanka is mandatory;
- availability of a bank account with the borrower;
- minimum, LKR - 2 thousand;
- maximum loan amount, LKR - 100 thousand;
- minimum repayment period - 121 days;
- maximum repayment period - 183 days;
- maximum APR - 36% ;
- early repayment penalty - yes/no.
Attention!
OnCredit provides easy loans online in Sri Lanka. Our main difference from traditional lending institutions in the country is that everything happens remotely, including: 
- filling out an application for a consumer loan;
- providing the company's employees with the applicant's documents;
- online loan approval;
-signing the loan agreement;
- electronic transfer of money to the personal details of the borrower.
